# Without this, qmlls and qmllint cannot resolve `pragma Singleton` reached
# through the `import "Ui" as Ui` directory import, and every member access on
# Compositor reports as missing. Quickshell itself does not need it.
#
# A qmldir hides every type it does not list: a new file under Ui/ needs a line
# here or it becomes unimportable.
singleton Compositor 1.0 Compositor.qml
Panel 1.0 Panel.qml
BarButton 1.0 BarButton.qml
